{
  "id": "note-20261116-6bde099e",
  "body": "<h2>模版:判断点在直线的哪边</h2>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">给定</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">判断</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的哪边</span></span></span></span> 想法：计算<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">pq</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span>  ,如果小于0在右边，大于0在左边</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><pre><code class=\"hljs language-cpp\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">#<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">define</span> vc pair&lt;int,int&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">driction</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(vc p,vc q,vc v)</span></span>{\n\tvc tmp;<span class=\"hljs-comment\">//pq</span>\n\ttmp.first = q.first - p.first;\n\ttmp.second = q.second - p.second;\n\t<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> (v.first*tmp.second - v.second*tmp.first); \n}</code></pre></div>\n<h2>模板:判断线段是否相交</h2>\n<p>跨立实验：另一条线段的两点应分步在线段的两侧 快速排斥实验：验证包围盒是否相交</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><pre><code class=\"hljs language-cpp\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">#<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">include</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&lt;algorithm&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">#<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">include</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">#<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">include</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&lt;cstdio&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">using</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">namespace</span> std;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">#<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">define</span> vc pair&lt;int,int&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">cross</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; a, <span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; b, <span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; c)</span> </span>{\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> (b.first - a.first) * (c.second - a.second) - (b.second - a.second) * (c.first - a.first);\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">bool</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">quickReject</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; a, <span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; b, <span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; c, <span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; d)</span> </span>{\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> !(<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">max</span>(a.first, b.first) &lt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">min</span>(c.first, d.first) ||\n             <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">max</span>(c.first, d.first) &lt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">min</span>(a.first, b.first) ||\n             <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">max</span>(a.second, b.second) &lt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">min</span>(c.second, d.second) ||\n             <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">max</span>(c.second, d.second) &lt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">min</span>(a.second, b.second));\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">bool</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">onSegment</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; p, <span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; a, <span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; b)</span> </span>{\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> p.first &gt;= <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">min</span>(a.first, b.first) &amp;&amp; p.first &lt;= <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">max</span>(a.first, b.first) &amp;&amp;\n           p.second &gt;= <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">min</span>(a.second, b.second) &amp;&amp; p.second &lt;= <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">max</span>(a.second, b.second);\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">bool</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">segmentsIntersect</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; A, <span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; B, <span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; C, <span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> vc&amp; D)</span> </span>{\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">quickReject</span>(A, B, C, D)) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> d1 = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">cross</span>(A, B, C);\n    <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> d2 = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">cross</span>(A, B, D);\n    <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> d3 = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">cross</span>(C, D, A);\n    <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> d4 = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">cross</span>(C, D, B);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> ((d1 &gt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> &amp;&amp; d2 &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> || d1 &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> &amp;&amp; d2 &gt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>) &amp;&amp;\n        (d3 &gt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> &amp;&amp; d4 &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> || d3 &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> &amp;&amp; d4 &gt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)) {\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>;\n    }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (d1 == <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">onSegment</span>(C, A, B)) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (d2 == <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">onSegment</span>(D, A, B)) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (d3 == <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">onSegment</span>(A, C, D)) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (d4 == <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">onSegment</span>(B, C, D)) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">()</span></span>{\n\tvc a,b,c,d;\n\tcout&lt;&lt;<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">segmentsIntersect</span>(a,b,c,d);\n\t<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>;\n}</code></pre></div>"
}
